@baseUrl = http://localhost:5190

### Open an account (copy the returned accountId into the variables below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "holderName": "Jane Doe" }

###
@accountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@otherAccountId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get account
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}

### Deposit
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 100.00 }

### Withdraw
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 30.00 }

### Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{accountId}}", "destinationAccountId": "{{otherAccountId}}", "amount": 10.00 }

### Freeze
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/freeze

### Unfreeze
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/unfreeze

### Close (requires zero balance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/close
